        /// Default value: PricingCycle=2
        /// 
        /// This parameter applies only to specific product types (ProductType is ddos_originpre_public_cn, ddosDip, ddoscoo, ddos_originpre_public_intl, ddosDip_intl, or ddoscoo_intl).
        /// 
